OL,3,GNEWSAFree trees given out to grow
OL,4,Abutterfly population
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community project aiming to increase
OL,7,Fthe butterfly population is giving away
OL,8,Fsmall trees for people to plant.
OL,10,FButterfly City, in Hull, which was set
OL,11,Fup in 2019 by Hull City Council and
OL,12,Fsupported by Hull West and Haltemprice
OL,13,FMP Emma Hardy, said people would be
OL,14,Fable to collect free alder buckthorn
OL,15,Fsaplings from nine pick-up points
OL,16,Facross the city in a bid to help boost
OL,17,Fthe numbers of Brimstone butterflies.
OL,19,FDirector Sean Clough said the group was
OL,20,Fgiving away 1500 buckthorns free to
OL,21,Fresidents, community groups, schools
OL,22,Fand organisations to plant.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
